But yes, I've heard of using bitter melatonin. It's actually in, I'm pretty sure it's in some supplements

00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:34,980
that we use. I could be involved though. But yeah, that's another

00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:56,560
nutrient that I look at. So I know bitter melatonin isn't herb that is used for decreasing sugar.

